; Disposable WB 3.1 Which no-match status probe. Output is retained in S:Shell-Startup.
FailAt 255
Path C:
Echo "BEGIN" >S:Shell-Startup
C:Which CD NORES >>S:Shell-Startup
Echo "CD-NORES RC=$RC RESULT2=$Result2" >>S:Shell-Startup
C:Which CopperOSMissingCommand >>S:Shell-Startup
Echo "MISSING RC=$RC RESULT2=$Result2" >>S:Shell-Startup
Echo "END" >>S:Shell-Startup
EndCLI >NIL:
